The main change was replacing the custom test launcher with a real `@vscode/test-electron` runner, switching the suite entry to Mocha discovery, and keeping the review-panel smoke coverage in [review.test.ts](/home/pete/cadres/lattice/extension/src/test/review.test.ts:1). I also added the required test deps in [package.json](/home/pete/cadres/lattice/extension/package.json:1) and removed the old custom harness.

Verification passed for:
