One environment limitation remains: the deploy copy to `~/.vscode/extensions/lattice.lattice-0.1.0/bin/` failed with a read-only filesystem error. The local copy to `extension/bin/` completed, and I recorded that explicitly in the result file, so the task status there is `partial` rather than falsely claiming full deploy completion.
